/-!
# Averaged confinement in the near-axis QA model: the literal amplitude `amp 3`

The exact Lie derivative `amp 3` (458 monomials, scaled to integers by `toFix cq`) is evaluated
once and checked against the literal `amp3Lit` (`amp3Lit_eq`). A separate module, so that this
kernel evaluation runs in its own process (see `Design/NearAxisQAAveraged`).
-/

